_al_rojo_sobre_un_yunque.jpg/500px-Trabajando_una_pieza_de_metal_al_rojo_sobre_un_yunque.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3b/Trabajando_una_pieza_de_metal_al_rojo_sobre_un_yunque.jpg/500px-Trabajando_una_pieza_de_metal_al_rojo_sobre_un_yunque.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Rust scale forming and flaking off from a steel bar heated to its forging temperature of 1200°C. Rapid oxidation occurs when heated steel is exposed to air.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ATrabajando_una_pieza_de_metal_al_rojo_sobre_un_yunque.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3e/Uithuizermeeden_de_Boer_02.JPG/500px-Uithuizermeeden_de_Boer_02.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3e/Uithuizermeeden_de_Boer_02.JPG/1280px-Uithuizermeeden_de_Boer_02.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3e/Uithuizermeeden_de_Boer_02.JPG/500px-Uithuizermeeden_de_Boer_02.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Cor-Ten is a group of steel alloys which were developed to eliminate the need for painting, and form a stable rust-like appearance after several years' exposure to weather.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AUithuizermeeden_de_Boer_02.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/36/Rust-AH-2022.jpg/500px-Rust-AH-2022.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/36/Rust-AH-2022.jpg/1280px-Rust-AH-2022.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/36/Rust-AH-2022.jpg